option.BLOOM.comment=Enable or disable the HDR bloom pass. When disabled, AuraLite skips all five bloom composite passes for lower GPU load.
option.HDR_BLOOM=Glow HDR
option.HDR_BLOOM.comment=Neart an glow Gáiseach leathan timpeall foinsí ró-gheal: diosca gréine/gealaí, laibhe, geataí, buaicphointí te. Úsáideann pasanna nua pirimide bloom.
value.HDR_BLOOM.1=Caoin
